   "parameters": {
    "content": "## SUB · Sage Desk brain (Lesson 5.1)\nThe one shared brain behind every channel adapter.\n\nIn: channel, user_id, text\nOut: reply, handover\n\nThis is a stand-in. Paste Boss 4's agent here (its tools, guardrails and Check If Evaluating), keeping these three inputs and two outputs.\n\nCredentials: OpenAI (select it in OpenAI Chat Model).\nPlaceholders: YOUR_MODEL.\n\nuser_id carries the channel prefix (wa-..., tg-..., web-...), so memory never mixes a WhatsApp number with a Telegram chat.",
